d States Air Force", "United States Navy", "National Air and Space Intelligence Center (NAISC)", "The New York Times", "Carthusian Order", "Wackenhut Corporation", "Vermont State Police", "United States Joint Chiefs of Staff", "Department of Defense (DOD)", "North Chicago VA Medical Center", "Project Blue Book", "Project Aquarius", "Stargate Project", "Center Lane (remote viewing program)", "Sun Streak (remote viewing program)", "Grill Flame (remote viewing program)", "Advanced Aerospace Threat Identification Program (AATIP)", "USA, Vermont, Mount Equinox", "USA, Ohio, Wright-Patterson Air Force Base", "USA, California, Lookout Mountain", "USA, Nevada, Papoose Lake", "Tau Ceti (star system)", "Zeta Reticuli (star system)", "David Grush\'s 2023 congressional testimony on UAP", "Jon Stewart\'s 2023 meeting with Ralph Blumenthal and Leslie Kean at the Midtown Hilton", "2023 warning to Jon Stewart from his National Air and Space Intelligence Center contact to cease communications", "Victor\'s 2008 warning against a 20th documentary anniversary", "2025 visit by Jon Stewart\'s investigator to the Charter House Transformational Monastery", "Charter House Transformational Monastery", "Midtown Hilton (Manhattan)", "Captain James Lovell Apollo 13 Surgical Center", "Q-94109A document (Dan Burisch)", "MJ-12 documents (Majestic Documents)", "America Unearthed (TV series)", "All the President\'s Men (film)", "Man on Fire (film)", "Catch-22 (novel)", "2017 New York Times AATIP expos\\u00e9 (Elizondo)", "Jon Stewart\'s FOIA request to the DIA for the Q-94109A document", "Jon Stewart\'s FOIA request to the Department of Defense for Colin Powell\'s travel schedule", "Extraterrestrial Biological Entity (EBE)", "Remote viewing", "Synthetic Astrobiological Extraterrestrial Races (SABER)", "Robinson, Cheryl Cross", "Andrew", "Lear, John", "Cassidy, Kerry", "Pemble, Brian", "Howe, Stanton", "Jones, Tommy Lee", "Cicero", "Sergeant Slaughter", "Walden, Clint", "Janet Airlines", "Reddit", "Shutterstock", "Corridor Crew", "2764th Detachment Wing", "Clint Walden\'s Night Shift", "Project Camelot", "Office of the Director of National Intelligence (ODNI)", "Lockheed Corporation", "Project Looking Glass", "Project Sidekick", "Project Galileo", "USA, California, Rancho Cucamonga", "USA, Arizona, Tucson", "USA, Virginia, Fort Belvoir", "2008 sighting of Victor at Rancho Cucamonga residence", "Space Cowboys (film)", "Groom Lake EG&G personnel entry log", "Men in Black (MIB)", "Stingray Centipede", "Sheep-dipping (intelligence cover technique)", "Kasternik", "Kaminski, Paul", "Kostelnik, Mike", "Wood, Ryan", "Andiamo, Adriano", "Sherlock, Arthur", "Dolan, Richard", "UAP Gerb", "Bermuda Biological Station", "United States Air Force Scientific Advisory Board (SAB)", "Office of the Under Secretary of Defense for Acquisition and Technology (USD(A&T))", "USA, Nevada, Tonopah Test Range", "Blue Room, Wright-Patterson Air Force Base", "OPNAC BBS-01 (offshore platform)", "S2 Alpha (Papoose Lake facility)", "Stanton-Howe logline", "Wilson-Davis memo", "OPNAC SOM1-01 Extraterrestrial Recovery Manual", "Military Bulletin Board (DOD internal message board)"]}}, "confidence": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0.0, "maximum": 1.0}}}}, "extraction_complete": {"type": "boolean"}}}', '--output-format', 'json']' timed out after 900 seconds
